text_01F8:
    string "最高視聴率はもらうピピッ♪"                ; en: I'll take the top ratings, pi-pi ♪

text_0213:
    string "ピピッ★テレビ見てねー♪"                 ; en: Pi-pip ★ Watch TV, okay ♪

text_022C:
    string "ブラウン管が重いピピッ≦%K薄型テレビになりた～いピピッ！"  ; en: My picture tube is heavy, pi-pip ≦ / I want to be a flat-screen TV, pi-pip!

text_0265:
    string "目標視聴率まで%Kあとちょっとだピピッ♪"         ; en: Just a little more to my / target ratings, pi-pip ♪

text_028C:
    string "薄型ＴＶに改造してもらうピピッ"              ; en: I'll get remodeled into a flat TV, pi-pip

text_02AB:
    string "デジタル放送開始だっピピッ"                ; en: Digital broadcasting is starting, pi-pip

text_02C6:
    string "いきなり視聴率が上がったピピッ♪"             ; en: My ratings suddenly went up, pi-pip ♪

text_02E7:
    string "大人気になったピピッ★"                  ; en: I've become hugely popular, pi-pip ★

text_02FE:
    string "もう止めることは出来ないピピッ∈"             ; en: Nothing can stop me now, pi-pip ∈

text_031F:
    string "誰も見てくれないっピピッ≦"                ; en: Nobody's watching me, pi-pip ≦

text_033A:
    string "ピピッ！電波状態がメチャクチャ"              ; en: Pi-pip! The reception is a mess

text_0359:
    string "ザァァァァァァァ・・・・%Kそのまましばらくお待ち下さい≦"  ; en: Zzzzzzzz.... / Please stand by ≦

text_0392:
    string "放送中止になりそうピピッ"                 ; en: Looks like the broadcast will be canceled, pi-pip

text_03AB:
    string "%NMYの%Kどーんといってみようピピッ"         ; en: <player>'s / let's go big, pi-pip

text_03CE:
    string "危機的状況に陥ってます%K（ニュースモードになってるらしい）"  ; en: We are in a critical situation / (apparently in news mode)

text_0409:
    string "ピピッ！危ないお店発見・・・"               ; en: Pi-pip! Found a dangerous store...

text_0426:
    string "おっきいお店は避けにくいピピッ"              ; en: Big stores are hard to avoid, pi-pip

text_0445:
    string "ピピッ！%Kハイパーモードで一気に通り抜ける！"      ; en: Pi-pip! / I'll zoom through in hyper mode!

text_0472:
    string "休業中ピピッ♪"                      ; en: Closed for now, pi-pip ♪

text_0481:
    string "休業中のお店は僕のもの～ピッ♭"              ; en: Closed stores are mine~ pip ♭

text_04A0:
    string "お休みだピピッ★"                     ; en: It's taking a break, pi-pip ★

text_04B1:
    string "商品を電波に乗せられないピピッ？"             ; en: Can't I put goods on the airwaves, pi-pip?

text_04D2:
    string "ＴＶショッピングで%K仕入れちゃダメなのかピピッ？"    ; en: Can't I restock / through TV shopping, pi-pip?

text_0503:
    string "仕入れ担当者は・・・%K僕だったピピッ？"         ; en: The one in charge of restocking... / was me, pi-pip?

text_052A:
    string "スポンサーになって欲しいピピッ"              ; en: I want you to be my sponsor, pi-pip

text_0549:
    string "銀行って儲かるのかピピッ？"                ; en: Does a bank make money, pi-pip?

text_0564:
    string "お金が欲しいピピッ"                    ; en: I want money, pi-pip

text_0577:
    string "ピッ！%Kホームランがでましたー♪"            ; en: Pip! / A home run~ ♪

text_0598:
    string "ピピッ！%K逆転に成功しましたー♪"            ; en: Pi-pip! / The comeback worked~ ♪

text_05B9:
    string "ピッ！%K大穴！大穴が出ましたー♪"            ; en: Pip! / A long shot! A long shot came in~ ♪

text_05DA:
    string "画面にノイズが入るっピピッ"                ; en: Noise on the screen, pi-pip

text_05F5:
    string "お・がとぎ・る・ピッ≦%K（音がとぎれるピピッ）"     ; en: S-und c-ts o-t, pip ≦ / (the sound cuts out, pi-pip)

text_0624:
    string "ピッ、ただいま落下中ぅぅピピッ"              ; en: Pip, falling right now, pi-pip

text_0643:
    string "ピッ！%NMYに小細工は%K効かないピピッ★"       ; en: Pip! Tricks don't work / on <player>, pi-pip ★

text_066A:
    string "ピッ？何かある・・・ピピッ？"               ; en: Pip? Is something there... pi-pip?

text_0687:
    string "そのくらいじゃ平気だよピピッ☆"              ; en: That much is nothing, pi-pip ☆

text_06A6:
    string "街頭テレビやるっピピッ"                  ; en: I'll be a street TV, pi-pip

text_06BD:
    string "ど～も～%NMYテレビでーす%Kピピッ♪"         ; en: Hel-lo, this is <player> TV / pi-pip ♪

text_06E0:
    string "ピピッ！%Kお店買うお金残ってるかなぁ？"         ; en: Pi-pip! / Do I have money left to buy a store?

text_0707:
    string "あんまりの仕打ちだピピッ≦"                ; en: That's too cruel, pi-pip ≦

text_0722:
    string "あんなの買えないっピピッ！"                ; en: I can't buy that, pi-pip!

text_073D:
    string "ＣＭ流す代わりに安くしてくれないか%Kピピッ≦"      ; en: Won't you make it cheaper if I run your ads, / pi-pip ≦

text_076A:
    string "ピ！給料取りに行きたいピピッ"               ; en: Pi! I want to go collect my pay, pi-pip

text_0787:
    string "銀行までたどり着けるかなピピッ？"             ; en: Can I make it to the bank, pi-pip?

text_07A8:
    string "うぉぉぉぉぉぉ%K（↑なんかエキサイトしてる・・・）"   ; en: Wooooooooh / (↑ getting excited about something...)

text_07DB:
    string "%NMYのお店が%K見当たらないピピッ≦"         ; en: I can't find / <player>'s stores, pi-pip ≦

text_07FE:
    string "画面が映らなくなったピピッ"                ; en: The screen went blank, pi-pip

text_0819:
    string "ここは%NMYが知らない%K異国の土地かピピッ≦"     ; en: Is this a foreign land / <player> doesn't know, pi-pip ≦

text_0844:
    string "ビデオデッキを置きたいピピッ"               ; en: I want to put out a VCR, pi-pip

text_0861:
    string "%NMYは品物じゃないピピッ！"              ; en: <player> is not merchandise, pi-pip!

text_087C:
    string "%NMY自身は販売できるか%Kピピッ？"          ; en: Can <player> itself / be sold, pi-pip?

text_089D:
    string "教えて！%Kどっちが天国ピピッ？"             ; en: Tell me! / Which way is heaven, pi-pip?

text_08BC:
    string "電波が混信してるピピッ≦"                 ; en: The signals are crossed, pi-pip ≦

text_08D5:
    string "ピピッ？番組選択の自由・・・！？"             ; en: Pi-pip? Freedom to choose the channel...!?

text_08F6:
    string "ピピッ！%Kエレベーターで気分転換♪"           ; en: Pi-pip! / A change of mood in the elevator ♪

text_0919:
    string "ふきふき♪%Kたまには画面をキレイにふくピピッ★"     ; en: Wipe wipe ♪ / Cleaning my screen once in a while, pi-pip ★

text_0948:
    string "ピピッ？%Kアンテナは平気かなピピッ"           ; en: Pi-pip? / Is my antenna all right, pi-pip

text_096B:
    string "腹ぺピピッ"                        ; en: Hungry, pi-pip

text_0976:
    string "映りが良くないピピッ"                   ; en: The picture's not good, pi-pip

text_098B:
    string "しゃべるテレビッピ"                    ; en: A talking TV, pip
    words 0    ; padding
